{"timestamp":"00:06:50.376","source":"Server","level":"LOG","message":"[browser] \"[v0] New incident generated:\" \"{\\n  id: \\u001b[32m'email-1'\\u001b[39m,\\n  payload: {\\n    attachments: [\\n      {\\n        details: \\u001b[32m'File contains form requesting login credentials'\\u001b[39m,\\n        name: \\u001b[32m'Account_Verification_Form.html'\\u001b[39m,\\n        size: \\u001b[33m125\\u001b[39m,\\n        suspicious: \\u001b[33mtrue\\u001b[39m,\\n        type: \\u001b[32m'HTML'\\u001b[39m\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    body: \\u001b[32m'Dear User,\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'We detected unusual activity on your Microsoft account. \\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'To prevent account suspension, please verify your identity within 24 hours.\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'Click here to verify: [Verify Your Account](http://security-microsoft.net/verify)\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'If you did not request this, please ignore this email.\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'Thank you,\\\\n'\\u001b[39m +\\n      \\u001b[32m'Microsoft Security Team'\\u001b[39m,\\n    clues: {\\n      attachmentAnalysis: \\u001b[32m'HTML file requesting login credentials is a major red flag. Microsoft does not send credentials requests via email.'\\u001b[39m,\\n      contextAnalysis: \\u001b[32m'You did not initiate any account activity. The \\\"unusual activity\\\" claim is vague and unspecific.'\\u001b[39m,\\n      languageAnalysis: \\u001b[32m'Urgent tone with 24-hour deadline is a common phishing tactic. Grammar is mostly correct but formal tone seems off.'\\u001b[39m,\\n      linkDetails: [\\n        \\u001b[32m'Link points to security-microsoft.net - mimics official domain but slightly different'\\u001b[39m,\\n        \\u001b[32m'No tracking or legitimate Microsoft URL patterns found'\\u001b[39m\\n      ],\\n      requestAnalysis: \\u001b[32m'Requesting account verification credentials via email is never legitimate. Real Microsoft uses secure portals.'\\u001b[39m,\\n      senderProfile: \\u001b[32m'Domain is suspicious - microsoft-support.net instead of microsoft.com. Legitimate Microsoft uses @microsoft.com domains.'\\u001b[39m\\n    },\\n    from: \\u001b[32m'Microsoft Security Team'\\u001b[39m,\\n    id: \\u001b[32m'email-1'\\u001b[39m,\\n    isLegitimate: \\u001b[33mfalse\\u001b[39m,\\n    senderDomain: \\u001b[32m'security@microsoft-support.net'\\u001b[39m,\\n    subject: \\u001b[32m'Action Required: Verify Your Microsoft Account'\\u001b[39m,\\n    threat: \\u001b[32m'phishing'\\u001b[39m,\\n    timestamp: \\u001b[32m'09:15 AM'\\u001b[39m,\\n    to: \\u001b[32m'you@akfung.com'\\u001b[39m\\n  },\\n  type: \\u001b[32m'email'\\u001b[39m\\n}\" \"(app/page.tsx:104:21)\""}
